Viktor 11.10.2026: «Не сохраняется выбор моделей у Художника после F5. Ничего не сохранилось кроме PROMPT поля». The lab's list had answered [] (lab 1375); before it came the choice held Krea alone, and a word typed in the prompt wrote Krea Q4 over the painter kept. Now keepForm leaves the painter and its fine-tune alone until the list has come or the user picks one (HeresyArtist.forget for the checks). The catalogs' «{0} take» and «{0} takes» taken out of the six: they read «From the take» as «Семплов: From the». Suite: suite-1375.part.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
